    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ustĭo</span></b> , ōnis,
			f.
		uro, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				burning</i>, <i>searing</i>, or <i>cauterizing</i> (post-Aug. and very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si costa cariosa est, inutilis ustio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 8,
					2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quaedam ustione sanantur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 15, 44, § 151</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vehementior sinapis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					20, 22, 87, § 239</span></i>
			.</div>
